                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4a77658-18a9-426b-ae91-b548c23fc5e8",
                                "sense_id": "09f30e60-81d8-3f05-9cd6-888fb443f7b7",
                                "text": "Вдруг, как э́то ча́сто быва́ет, звук го́на мгнове́нно прибли́зился, как бу́дто вот-во́т пе́ред ни́ми сами́ми бы́ли ла́ющие рты соба́к и улюлю́канье Дани́лы.",
                                "translation": "Then, unexpectedly, as often happens, the sound of the hunt suddenly approached, as if the hounds in full cry and Daniel ulyulyuing were just in front of them.",
                                "english": "Then, unexpectedly, as often happens, the sound of the hunt suddenly approached, as if the hounds in full cry and Daniel ulyulyuing were just in front of them."
